<title>BAHRAIN: PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - March 13.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - March 13.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Bahraini press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>BAHRAIN TRIBUNE</p>
<p>- Gulf Air plane crash pilot out of danger.</p>
<p>GULF DAILY NEWS</p>
<p>- Bid to clamp total ban on industrial trawling.</p>
<p>- Bahraini Kuwaiti Insurance Company posts 550,838 dinar profit in 1996.</p>
<p>AL-AYAM</p>
<p>- An Italian trade team arrives in Bahrain for talks on ways of boosting investments.</p>
<p>AKHBAR AL-KHALEEJ</p>
<p>- Bourse linkage between Bahrain, Egypt and Jordan expected in May.</p>
